      "title": "Adjunct Faculty - Medical Surgical RN - Geauga Campus",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty - Medical Surgical RN - Geauga Campus - Burton, Ohio, United States Adjunct Faculty - Medical Surgical RN - Geauga Campus - Burton, Ohio, United States Employment Kiosk mode Adjunct Faculty - Medical Surgical RN Geauga Campus - Burton , Ohio Adjunct Faculty - Medical Surgical RN Geauga Campus - Burton Faculty Opening on: Sep 28 2026 Closing on: Oct 29 2026 224544 Dean, Geauga Campus - Geauga Campus [400055] Job Title: Adjunct Faculty Physical Location: Geauga Campus - Burton, Ohio Salary: Basic Function: Kent State at Geauga seeks a qualified pool of Medical Surgical RN clinical adjunct for the BSN program. Additional Basic Function – if applicable: Examples of Duties: Duties/essential functions may include, but not be limited to, the following: Supervise and evaluate students on the clinical floor. Additional Examples of Duties – if applicable: Minimum Qualifications: Masters degree in Nursing preferred. Must have 2 years’ experience as RN Preferred Qualifications – if applicable: 2 years’ experience in Medical Surgical nursing. Assessments: Asterisk (*) indicates knowledge, skills, abilities which require assessments Working Conditions / Physical Requirements: Light work-Exerting up to 20 pounds of force occasionally, and/or up to 10 pounds of force frequently to move objects. Incumbent must be able to communicate with others. Incumbent may be required to travel from building to building frequently and off campus occasionally. Special Instructions Summary: Please complete and online application and submit a CV. In addition, please forward 3 letters of reference to: Jessica Larubina MSN, CMSRN Interim BSN Program Coordinator, Geauga Campus jlarubin@kent.edu Additional Information: Must pass a security check. We are an equal opportunity employer and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, or any 